                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2020 Terrible Posture Games, Inc. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved. Unreal®, Unreal Engine™,  the circle-U logo and the Powered by Unreal Engine™ logo are trade­marks or registered trademarks of Epic Games, Inc. in the USA and elsewhere.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
